### Registro correcto
POST http://localhost:8080/api/vehiculos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 10,
  "marca": "Toyota",
  "modelo": "Corolla",
  "anio": 2024,
  "precio": 150000,
  "color": "Blanco"
}

### Precio negativo
POST http://localhost:8080/api/vehiculos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "marca": "Honda",
  "modelo": "Civic",
  "anio": 2022,
  "precio": -5,
  "color": "Gris"
}

### Falta la marca
POST http://localhost:8080/api/vehiculos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "modelo": "Sentra",
  "anio": 2020,
  "precio": 98000,
  "color": "Negro"
}

### JSON mal formado
POST http://localhost:8080/api/vehiculos
Content-Type: application/json

{ "marca": "Mazda", "anio": "dos mil" }